This project integrates LightNav-0 with Scout Mini and Odin1. It includes
modified LightNav robot-side packages and vendored hardware drivers:

- LightNav-0: Light Origins Team; package maintainer xiaoyang (Lightrobo).
  https://github.com/lightorigins/LightNav-0
- Odin ROS driver: Copyright 2025 Manifold Tech Ltd.
  https://github.com/manifoldsdk/odin_ros_driver
- Scout ROS 2 and AgileX UGV SDK: original authors and copyright holders are
  identified in their source headers, licenses, and notices under src/drivers/.

Retain the component-specific licenses and attribution notices. In particular,
the Scout wheel Xacro files retain their BSD-3-Clause terms. See LICENSES.md
and the UPSTREAM_VERSION files for the scope and origin of each component.
